  "goodToKnow": "Das Achtelfinale is the round of 16 in a tournament: im Achtelfinale ausscheiden (to be knocked out in the round of 16). German counts by fractions of the final: das Achtelfinale (eighth-final), das Viertelfinale (quarter-final), das Halbfinale (semi-final), das Finale or Endspiel. Das Achtel is an eighth, as in ein Achtel Wein (an eighth of a litre). Germany won the World Cup in 1954, 1974, 1990 and 2014."
